OL,3,GNEWSA'Difficult' fire station care home
OL,4,Aplan dropped
OL,5,
OL,6,FA care company plans to sell a
OL,7,F100-year-old former fire station in
OL,8,Fnorth Liverpool after saying it can no
OL,9,Flonger afford to redevelop it.
OL,11,FBest Care Liverpool bought the former
OL,12,FAintree Fire Station, on Longmoor Lane
OL,13,Fin Fazakerley, in 2024 with plans to
OL,14,Fcreate four flats and offices.
OL,16,FThe company's director, Nora Darwin,
OL,17,Ftold the Local Democracy Reporting
OL,18,FService (LDRS) that dealing with the
OL,19,Fcouncil's planning department had been
OL,20,F"difficult, time-consuming and costly".
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
