OL,3,GNEWSA'Difficult' fire station care home
OL,4,Aplan dropped
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiverpool City Council said it had
OL,7,Fworked constructively with the company
OL,8,Fand had to assess proposals in line
OL,9,Fwith planning policy and the wider
OL,10,Fpublic interest.
